===
title: LabPrefightIntro
---
Jamie: You did this all by yourself?
Uncle: It’s like you said. The Waste is only getting worse down there. I needed a way to help, and here she is.
Jamie: It’s… incredible.
Dinky: …
Uncle: Wait ‘til you see her in action. Here, go grab me one of those Waste objects on the table there. I’ll show you how she works.
Jamie: Here you go!
Uncle: Right. Here we are.
Uncle loads the object into the machine and turns it on.
Machine: Clang... Whirrrrr... Clank...
Uncle: Done. Go on and grab it now, Jamie.
Jamie: Wow…
Uncle: Good as new, eh?
Jamie: And it can do the same for Dinky?
Dinky: Grrrrrr…
Uncle: No reason why it shouldn’t. I’ve wanted to help out the infected animals ever since I started building the machine.
Uncle: Though it took a long time to get it runnin’ how I wanted it to. That’s what all these critters have been waiting for.
Uncle: You came at a good time there, Jamie. I was just about to do my first live trial when I found you. Dinky’s a lucky little fella, first dibs! 
Jamie: And you’re positive he’ll be safe?
Uncle: Don’t worry, Jamie. If anything goes wrong, there’s a kill switch that should let him out right away. It’ll be okay, promise.
Jamie: Alright, then. Come on, Dinky. You ready?
Dinky: Grrrrrr… nyeh, nyeh!
Jamie: Dinky...
Jamie: I know you’re scared. But this is going to help you! It’ll all be worth it, you’ll see. Right?
Dinky: Nyeh, NYEH!
Jamie: Ready Dinky? One, two, three!
===
title: LabPrefightDinkyHurt
---
Jamie: Dinky?! Uncle, what’s happening?!
Machine: Unexpected levels of Waste concentration detected, initiating hyper-cleaning protocol.
Uncle: What?! His Waste… it seems to be making the machine act on its own! Jamie! Cover me as I work on shutting off the machine.
Uncle: Pull the kill switch levers on any tanks that may activate! That should help short circuit the machine and stop any monsters from escaping! 
===
title: LabPrefightDinkyThrown
---
Dinky: NYEH!
Jamie: It’s okay boy! It’s okay! You’re gonna be okay.
Uncle: We’re here to help you, little guy. Won’t be more than a moment. You ready, Jamie?
Jamie: Ready. Make it quick, please…
Uncle: Right, here we go.
===
title: LabEpilogue
---
Jamie: Dinky!!! My precious munchkin! 
Dinky: Haruuupptt! 
 Dinky and Jamie embrace, jumping in delight as they finally meet again. Uncle trails behind, folding his arms and sighing. 
Uncle: I think I understand it now. The Waste was never the problem. All it did was change a few things around here, nothing more.
Jamie: It’s alright, Uncle. The more important thing is that everybody’s safe and sound now. Right, Dinky? 
Dinky: Plerrkk!
Uncle pats Dinky’s head lovingly.
Uncle: You’re right, Jamie. And I’m glad that Dinky made it out okay even though I put him through all that. Sorry ‘bout that, Dinky.
Dinky: Greahh!!  
Uncle: I wonder what my brother would say about all of this. And all them townspeople. 
Jamie: Actually, Uncle, since we now know the Waste isn’t harmful, don’t you think we should try and move everybody above ground again? 
Uncle: Oh, definitely. It’s time for another journey, kid. But this time, together. 
===
title: LabFightComplete
---
Jamie: Uncle?! Is that it, its finally over?
Uncle: Yes Jamie, its over. Now let's get your Dinky down..
===
title: RuinedCityIntro
---
Jamie: Argh, nothing... the meteor did a real number on this place. What about you, boy? Smell anything? 
Dinky: Hrrrmmmm. Nyeh…
Jamie: It’s alright, buddy. I’m just glad we all made it out. That’s all that matters, right? 
Dinky chirps, and Jamie gives him a scratch behind the ears.
Jamie: Glad you agree. Everyone back home thought we’d never see the surface again. But now that we’re here… maybe it’s not so impossible after all.
Dinky: Hummmmmmm…
Jamie: Wouldn’t that be something, huh? Everyone back up here? But if the Waste got to everything, they’d never…
Voice: Jamie?
Dinky: !
Jamie: Huh? Who’s there?
===
title: RuinedCityReunion
---
Uncle: *chuckles* ‘Course I am. Who do you take me for? 
Jamie: *giggles, tears sliding down her cheeks* I missed you so much, Uncle.
Uncle: I missed you more, sprout. You got my letters then?
Jamie: Sure did. They helped us find the way.
Dinky: Nyeh!
Uncle: What made you decide to come? Your parents were none too fond of the idea when I left. 
Jamie: Right. Dinky got infected by the Waste. It’s been seeping farther and farther down, Uncle. It’s real bad.
Jamie: No one would help us… I didn't see another way. Can you help Dinky?
Dinky: …
Uncle: He’s been got good… but I’ve been studying the Waste. I think I’ve got just the thing. Come with me.
===
title: RuinedCityUncleReveal
---
Uncle: It is you, kid. You made it!
Jamie: Uncle? Uncle! You’re alive!
===
